{"displayStem":"그림은 치료가 질병 경과를 바꾸지 않는다고 설정한 동일한 가상 환자의 두 진단 경로이다. 검진 경로와 증상 경로의 진단·사망 시점을 비교한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 375\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 28의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"375\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"75\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">동일한 가상 질병 경과</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">검진 경로</text><path d=\"M80 120L600 120\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M80.0 115L80.0 125\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><path d=\"M253.33333333333331 115L253.33333333333331 125\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"253.33333333333331\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">55</text><path d=\"M426.66666666666663 115L426.66666666666663 125\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"426.66666666666663\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path d=\"M600.0 115L600.0 125\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">65</text><rect x=\"218.33333333333331\" y=\"95\" width=\"70\" height=\"45\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"253.33333333333331\" y=\"125.5\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">진단</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"95\" width=\"75\" height=\"45\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"597.5\" y=\"125.5\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">사망</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">증상 경로</text><path d=\"M80 245L600 245\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M80.0 240L80.0 250\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50</text><path d=\"M253.33333333333331 240L253.33333333333331 250\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"253.33333333333331\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">55</text><path d=\"M426.66666666666663 240L426.66666666666663 250\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"426.66666666666663\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path d=\"M600.0 240L600.0 250\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">65</text><rect x=\"391.66666666666663\" y=\"220\" width=\"70\" height=\"45\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"426.66666666666663\" y=\"250.5\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">진단</text><